    rubrique: "ex26", rubriqueNom: "العامل المشترك المخفيّ وراء إشارة", difficulte: "difficile",
    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>نعتبر العبارة، حيث x عدد حقيقي:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = (2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)(2x - 1) - (<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - 2)(x - 1)</span><br>اكتب a في صيغة جداء<br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>نعتبر العبارة، حيث x عدد حقيقي:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = (2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)(2x - 1) - (<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - 2)(x - 1)</span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 3x<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">40</span></span></span><br>اكتب b في صيغة جداء<br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>نعتبر العبارة، حيث x عدد حقيقي:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = (2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)(2x - 1) - (<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - 2)(x - 1)</span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 3x<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">40</span></span></span><br>بيّن أنّ:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a + b = 2(3x - 2)</span><br><span class=\"q\">4) </span>نعتبر العبارة، حيث x عدد حقيقي:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = (2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)(2x - 1) - (<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - 2)(x - 1)</span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 3x<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">40</span></span></span><br>بيّن أنّ:<br>أوجد x في حالة a و b متقابلان",
    correction: [{"quoi":"","math":"<b>1)</b>"},{"quoi":"نلاحظ العلاقة بين القوسين","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - 2 = -(2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)</span>"},{"quoi":"نغيّر إشارة الحدّ الثاني","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">-(<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - 2)(x - 1) = (2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)(x - 1)</span>"},{"quoi":"نضع <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)</span> عاملا مشتركا","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = (2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)[(2x - 1) + (x - 1)]</span>"},{"quoi":"نجمع ما بين المعقفين","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(2x - 1) + (x - 1) = 3x - 2</span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = (2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)(3x - 2)</span>"},{"quoi":"","math":"<b>2)</b>"},{"quoi":"نتعرّف على العامل المشترك","math":"الحدّان يحتويان على الجذر <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"نبسّط الجذر","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">40</span></span> = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">4 × 10</span></span> = 2<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"نضع <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span></span> عاملا مشتركا","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">3x<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - 2<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>(3x - 2)</span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>(3x - 2)</span>"},{"quoi":"","math":"<b>3)</b>"},{"quoi":"نستعمل الشكلين المفكّكين","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a + b = (2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)(3x - 2) + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>(3x - 2)</span>"},{"quoi":"نضع <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(3x - 2)</span> عاملا مشتركا","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)(3x - 2) + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>(3x - 2) = (3x - 2)((2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>) + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>)</span>"},{"quoi":"يتلاشى الجذر","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">(2 - <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>) + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> = 2</span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a + b = 2(3x - 2)</span>"},{"quoi":"","math":"<b>4)</b>"},{"quoi":"شرط التقابل","math":"العددان متقابلان يعني أنّ مجموعهما معدوم"},{"quoi":"نستعمل نتيجة السؤال 3","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">2(3x - 2) = 0</span>"},{"quoi":"جداء معدوم","math":"العدد 2 غير معدوم، إذن <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">3x - 2 = 0</span>"},{"quoi":"نحلّ","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">x = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"نتحقّق","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a + b = 0</span>"}],
